  "ingredients": [
    "1 (1 1/2 inch) piece fresh turmeric root, peeled and grated",
    "1 (1/2 inch) piece fresh ginger root, peeled and grated",
    "1 tablespoon honey",
    "1 cup unsweetened almond milk",
    "1 pinch ground turmeric",
    "1 pinch ground cinnamon"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mizvADSm0k6OrVPCDOu5YrGxPhQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-244623-turmeric-milk-VAT-step-01-a4d2a90531f145bc9c11ca04c8f11383.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/244623/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine turmeric root, ginger root, and honey together in a bowl, crushing the turmeric and ginger as much as possible.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/kEwcgt9CIacX2gBozyz4JgpdzMs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-244623-turmeric-milk-VAT-step-02-48a6bdf9096549bea193fb218b442b97.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/244623/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat almond milk in a saucepan over medium-low heat. Once small bubbles begin to form around the edges, reduce heat to low.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/AVk9Jq4OyPhdYO10qBeCbBHIhig=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-244623-turmeric-milk-VAT-step-03-1ab02a21072d41b787bda56d2dc670bd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/244623/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer about 2 tablespoon milk to turmeric mixture to allow mixture to soften and honey to melt into a paste-like mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QDd9pKN29ojAAhj4UVB_v3ZgtnQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-244623-turmeric-milk-VAT-step-04-5fc86370cf644dcf8dc8db18f463be6b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/244623/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix the turmeric paste into milk in the saucepan; raise temperature to medium-low and cook, stirring continuously, until fully combined. Blend with an immersion blender for a smooth texture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Dl7t0vezJodplRhto7LsmgySoKQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-244623-turmeric-milk-VAT-step-05-2f3d163223c24ad69e1a0bae2e97baae.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/244623/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour turmeric tea into a mug and top with ground turmeric and cinnamon.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BtqOKfcwNAfPtJP_r7rx2yKV-TQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-244623-turmeric-milk-VAT-step-06-db4b8135ff1049f98f1bbd52c70fc6fd.jpg"
